Subject: IR3 Operator Trace Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

& [ExpectedOperatorTraceLedger: IR3OperatorHarness] is the expected trace ledger for success-oriented fixture cases
  + [fixture_id] is valid_contract_request_success
  + [expected_operator_contract_id] is contract_driven_operator_runner
  + [expected_operator_contract_version] is v1
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is success
  + [expected_output_kind] is operator_result
  + [expected_trace_schema_version] is ir3-operator-trace-event-v1
  + [expected_trace_status] is generated_projection_only
  + [expected_non_authority_warning] is present
  + [expected_generated_output_ref_state] is present_or_empty_but_declared
  + [acceptance_status] is expected

& [TraceIdentityRequirementSet] is the expected identity field set for all operator traces
  + [required_trace_field] is trace_id
  + [required_trace_field] is trace_uuid
  + [required_trace_field] is run_id
  + [required_trace_field] is event_id
  + [required_trace_field] is slice_id
  + [required_trace_field] is operator_contract_id
  + [required_trace_field] is operator_contract_version
  + [required_trace_field] is operator_request_ref
  + [required_trace_field] is input_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is authority_basis_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is source_ref_set
  + [required_trace_field] is outcome_kind
  + [required_trace_field] is non_authority_warning
